  <description>Shared base body for the generic airship SITL variants: 10.97 m x 2.61 m spheroid hull (fineness 4.2), gondola, cruciform tail visuals, standard PX4 sensor suite, buoyancy-neutral mass budget. Not meant to be spawned directly - use a propulsion variant such as airship_vectored_independent that includes it.</description>
</model>
